### Обучение команды и change management

Change management обычно недооценивают, хотя у IBM Carbon и Shopify Polaris это часть операционной модели: обучение, meetups, tutorials, office hours, документация и design reviews поддерживают adoption ([What is Carbon?](https://carbondesignsystem.com/all-about-carbon/what-is-carbon/), [Updating Illustrations at Scale](https://shopify.engineering/updating-illustrations-shopify-scale)).

Практически работающий минимум:

- запускать еженедельные office hours;
- вести “migration clinic” для продуктовых команд;
- делать короткие screencasts по новым компонентам и breaking changes;
- завести шаблон PR/RFC для изменений в системе;
- раз в месяц публиковать “what changed / what to migrate / what is deprecated”.

### Примеры design tokens и token pipeline

Пример токенов в DTCG-совместимом JSON:

```json
{
  "color": {
    "gray": {
      "100": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#F5F7FA" },
      "900": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#111827" }
    },
    "brand": {
      "500": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#2563EB" }
    },
    "text": {
      "primary": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.gray.900}" },
      "inverse": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#FFFFFF" }
    },
    "bg": {
      "surface": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#FFFFFF" },
      "brand": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.brand.500}" }
    }
  },
  "space": {
    "100": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "4px" },
    "200": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "8px" },
    "300": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "12px" }
  },
  "radius": {
    "100": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "8px" }
  }
}
```

Пример component tokens:

```json
{
  "button": {
    "primary": {
      "bg": {
        "default": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.bg.brand}" },
        "hover": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#1D4ED8" }
      },
      "text": {
        "default": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.text.inverse}" }
      },
      "padding": {
        "x": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{space.300}" },
        "y": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{space.200}" }
      },
      "radius": {
        "default": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{radius.100}" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Пример структуры наборов для Figma/Tokens Studio:

```json
{
  "global/colors": {},
  "global/spacing": {},
  "semantic/light": {},
  "semantic/dark": {},
  "components/button": {},
  "components/input": {}
}
```

Минимальный `style-dictionary` конфиг:

```json
{
  "source": ["tokens/**/*.json"],
  "platforms": {
    "css": {
      "transformGroup": "css",
      "buildPath": "build/css/",
      "files": [
        {
          "destination": "variables.css",
          "format": "css/variables"
        }
      ]
    },
    "js": {
      "transformGroup": "js",
      "buildPath": "build/js/",
      "files": [
        {
          "destination": "tokens.js",
          "format": "javascript/es6"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
